SUMMARY:Dopamine v3.0.12
DESCRIPTION:Dopamine 3.0.12 | Dopamine\n\n- Add workaround for stock issue 
 that causes touch not to work on certain A10/A11 aftermarket screens after
  a userspace reboot (Contributed by @moezemara)\n- Fix some system prefere
 nce plists being redirected to /var/jb in rootlesshook (Contributed by @ve
 rygenericname)
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/dopamine.json
