SUMMARY:Dopamine v3.0.11
DESCRIPTION:Dopamine 3.0.11 | Dopamine\n\n- Fix support for iOS 26.0 beta 1
  [3.0.1 regression]\n- Fix boot logo not being cleaned up correctly before
  backboardd starts\, fixes framebuffer getting stuck with it's last conten
 t during sbreload when a boot logo is used (now the screen will correctly 
 fade to a black screen like when no boot logo is used)\n- Update opainject
  and litehook
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/dopamine.json
